              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Illuminati is a commercial Steve Jackson Games card game where secret societies compete to control groups and build a conspiracy network."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Steve Jackson Games released Illuminati in 1982 after developing a tongue-in-cheek game about secret-conspiracy themes inspired by The Illuminatus! Trilogy."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
