              "text": "Dedicated Illuminati cards and money tokens"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Illuminati cards and money tokens, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Prepare Dedicated Illuminati cards and money tokens and deal or lay out cards according to the documented Illuminati rules before play begins."
